h-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "स्थूल꣫\n— 1〉 Adj. (f. आ꣫)\n — a〉 grob, dick, gross, feist, massiv. Compar. स्थूलतर.\n — b〉 grob in übertragener Bed. (Vergehen u. s. w.).\n — c〉 dumm.\n — d〉 grob, so v. a. nicht präcis, präterpropter bestimmt.\n — e〉 in der Philosophie grob, so v. a. materiell, für die Sinne wahrnehmbar.\n— 2〉 m.\n — a〉 Artocarpus integrifolius^1.\n — b〉 N. pr. eines Wesens im Gefolge Śivaʼs.\n— 3〉 m. n. gaṇa अर्धर्चादि.\n— 4〉 f. स्थूला\n — a〉 Scindapsus officinalis.\n — b〉 Cucumis utilissimus.\n — c〉 grosse Kardamomen.\n— 5〉 n.\n — a〉 der grobe, wahrnehmbare Körper.\n — b〉 = कूट. — दृढस्थूल R. GORR. 2,114,5 fehlerhaft für ˚स्थूण, *स्थूलनिम्नानि 6,89,18 für स्थल˚.\n[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk, Thomas Malten on 20241207. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/PWK/issues/111.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["स्थूलं", "स्थूलः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["sTUlaM", "sTUlaH"]}], "sTuRa": [{"id": "sTURa", "headword": "स्थूण", "headword_slp1": "sTURa", "fold": "sTuRa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "— 1〉 m. N. pr.\n — a〉 eines Sohnes des Viśvāmitra.\n — b〉 eines Yakṣa.\n— 2〉 f. स्थू꣫णा (n.)\n — a〉 Pfosten, Pfeiler, Säule.\n — b〉 = सूर्मि 3〉.\n — c〉 wohl Bein. in छिन्नस्थूण (Stier).\n — d〉 angeblich = रज्जु Strick, Seil HEMĀDRI 1,632,11. 13.\n — e〉 eine best. Krankheit.\n— 3〉 f. ई unbebautes Land DURGĀDĀSA zu VOP. nach AUFRECHT.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "sTuRakarRa": [{"id": "sTURakarRa", "headword": "स्थूणकर्ण", "headword_slp1": "sTURakarRa", "fold": "sTuRakarRa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "स्थूणकर्ण m. N. pr. eines Ṛṣi MBH. 3,26,23.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}, {"id": "sTURAkarRa", "headword": "स्थूणाकर्ण", "headword_slp1": "sTURAkarRa", "fold": "sTuRakarRa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "se